{
  "version": 3,
  "principles": {
    "role_executability": "A routed substantive role needs a role-local executable method, not merely a description/checklist plus root pointer. Evaluate the characteristic core loop, conditional decisions, evidence discipline, stop/escalation and result semantics.",
    "role_contract_shape": "Standardize by semantic function, not headings: Ownership -> Invocation -> Method -> Boundaries -> Result. Each function needs a clear primary locus; merged/specialized sections are valid and cosmetic duplicate summaries are not required.",
    "protocol_composition": "Evaluate producer output, parent transformation, consumer input, and consumer standing contract as one interface. Per-file correctness does not prove handoff correctness.",
    "anti_gaming": "The gate exists to falsify the candidate. Keyword presence, prompt length, mutation retention and current-candidate wording cannot independently prove adequacy. REVIEW is release-blocking when semantic evidence is too sparse for an honest PASS."
  },
